# Purpose: Write each object from a saved API array as a compact JSONL record for downstream stream tools.
# Inputs: fixtures/069/export.json contains Saved API export containing an array of event objects.
# Outputs: Sorted-key compact JSONL written to events.jsonl and echoed.
accept export_path as text with default "fixtures/069/export.json"
run cat with path export_path
then jq with filter ".records[]" and flags ["-c", "-S"]
then save to "events.jsonl"
then cat with path "events.jsonl"
